- Excellent communication habits that are consistently prompt and responsive;
- Excellent organizational skills particularly regarding prioritizing and following through on tasks;
- Thrives in a fast-paced, highly structured, high volume work environment while maintaining quality standards;
- Consistent ability to pay close attention to detail and follow directions: both written and oral;
- Excellent, consistent computer skills â\x80\x93 including case management software, Word, and email â\x80\x93 and comfort with learning new programs;
- Motivation and enthusiasm for helping communities in need, and ability to work with people from a range of backgrounds â\x80\x93 including low-income clients and LSNYC staff;
